-- Talent companions, batch 1: plain bonuses (scan: enchants/talent-companions.csv, PR #257).
-- The pattern behind #151 and #148: a talent's bonus sits in a hidden companion spell that Ascension's own server
-- applied and ours never did. Each rank below now applies its companion while the talent is on a character (an
-- aura link, as for Master Summoner in 140-talent-fixes.sql). Data only: no build. Needs a server start.
-- Safe to run again: 000-reset removes the spell_linked_spell rows marked WCME: and the spell_dbc rows listed in
-- wcme_owned, and this file puts them back. None of the owned spells below has a spell_dbc row in the core.
-- Each pair was read by hand (talent and companion effects, tooltip) on 24 Nov 2026. Not tested in game: James's
-- testing policy, so these stay unverified until a player report or an automated test.

-- 1. Stun and fear duration cuts. Iron Will, Stoicism, Unbreakable Will, Unyielding Faith and On a Pale Horse keep
-- their stun and fear cuts in companions 902300-902321. Every tooltip says the cut does not stack with other stun
-- (or fear) reduction, but the companions use the aura that adds up (232). A Hero can hold several of these talents,
-- so our copies use the aura that does not add up (234): the core then takes the strongest single cut, or the sum
-- of ordinary cuts, whichever is larger (Unit.cpp, duration calculation). Values are unchanged.
-- Unbreakable Will's and On a Pale Horse's tooltips also name fear; their fear companions (902315-902319,
-- 902320-902321) are not quoted in the tooltip but carry the talent's name and numbers, so they are linked too.
-- On a Pale Horse is a talent that teaches two passives; it puts no aura on the character itself, so its links hang
-- off the taught passive that carries the mounted speed (51983 rank 1, 51986 rank 2).
-- What the talents keep doing themselves: Iron Will the charm cut, Unbreakable Will the silence cut, Unyielding
-- Faith the disorient cut, Stoicism the dispel resistance. Those still use the adding aura, as before.
DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (902300, 902301, 902302, 902303, 902304, 902305, 902306, 902307, 902308, 902309, 902310, 902311, 902312, 902313, 902314, 902315, 902316, 902317, 902318, 902319, 902320, 902321);

-- 2. Capstone threat cut. Seven talents end in the same capstone: threat reduced by 30% (957339, "Generic Capstone
-- Threat Reduction"). The tooltip shows it greyed out until the final rank, so only the final rank links it. One
-- shared spell, so two such talents give one 30% cut, as the tooltip says ("does not stack with similar capstone
-- effects"). Known edge: with two of these talents, losing one (a reroll) removes the shared aura until the next
-- login.

-- 3. Plain bonuses, every rank.
--   Answered Prayers (5 ranks): the healing bonus and the extra Holy damage (918155-918169).
--   Arctic Reach (2 ranks): spell range 3 / 6 yards for Mage spells (829023, 829014). Icy Reach, a Death Knight
--     talent, quotes the same Mage companions; it is held back (a Hero with both at different ranks would get 9).
--   Booming Voice (2 ranks): Demoralizing Shout's attack power cut (411140, 411141).
--   Demonic Mind: the healing-done drawback while it is active (283943). The talent is a toggle with an aura, so the
--     link follows it on and off.
--   Feral Instinct (3 ranks): the all-damage bonus while Tiger's Fury is up, as extra points on Tiger's Fury's own
--     damage effect (816947-816949). Its capstone is already on the talent itself.
--   Filthy Tricks (2 ranks): Gloomblade damage (858412, 858413).
--   Hawk Eye (3 ranks): ranged range for Hunter spells (829020-829022). The talent's own range effect names only
--     Focused Burst (SpellAffect.dbc), which the companion's mask cannot reach, so nothing doubles.
--   Inner Demons: Demonic Embrace's Stamina bonus (101443; its targets are named in SpellAffect.dbc).
--   Sanctity of Battle (3 ranks): critical strike chance (965980-965982).
--   Setup (3 ranks): Ghostly Strike's duration (965832-965834).
--   Shield of Wrath: Avenger's Shield damage (281935).
--   Tactical Mastery (3 ranks): armour from items, Stamina and Devastate damage (812295, 812676, 812677). The
--     rank 1 companion alone requires a weapon; a linked aura with a weapon requirement is taken off when the weapon
--     is and is not put back until the next login, so our copy of 812295 drops the requirement, matching ranks 2
--     and 3. Its capstone (stagger) is a separate, later batch.
--   Unleashed Rage (3 ranks): Fire, Frost and Nature damage while Shamanistic Rage is up, as points added to
--     Shamanistic Rage's empty damage effect (965657-965659). Ranks 2 and 3 add flat points; rank 1 adds a
--     percentage of an empty value, which is nothing. Our copy of 965657 adds flat points (aura 107), so rank 1
--     gives the 3% its tooltip quotes.
DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (812295);
DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` IN (965657);

-- Held back from this batch, each for a reason (later batches): Icy Reach (Mage companion on a Death Knight talent),
-- Glyph of Trueshot Aura (only while Trueshot Aura is learned), Divinity (only on Path of Strength), Corrupted Bear
-- Form (only in Bear Form), Swashbuckler: Flurry of Blows (only while Swashbuckling), Bloodletting (its companion
-- needs code no one has written), Two-Handed Weapon Mastery (weapon-dependent companion), Thrust and Weighted
-- Reinforcement (active abilities: no aura for a link to hang off).
